# Keep environment variables out of version control
.env

# Local SQLite files used transiently to generate Prisma migrations for the Turso/libSQL
# datasource (Prisma Migrate's CLI can't connect to remote libsql:// URLs directly — migrations
# are generated against a local file db, then applied to Turso separately). Never commit these.
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

/generated/prisma
backend.zip
